<title>USA: WellCare Management names president.</title>
<headline>WellCare Management names president.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTON, N.Y. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>WellCare Management Group Inc said on Tuesday that it named Joseph Papa president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Papa replaces founder Edward Ullmann, who remains a director of the company, chairman of WellCare of New York and a director of WellCare of Connecticut, the company said.</p>
<p>WellCare said Papa is a certified public accountant and management consultant, who has served in many executive posts of managed care firms since 1979.</p>
